{
  "doc": [
    "The exchanges of RFC 0001's remote wire, in order, against a served workspace laid out as:",
    "inside.txt (ok), sub/a.txt (a), alias.txt -> inside.txt, linkout -> ../outside/secret.txt;",
    "kind/<code> refused with that code's kind, its served text naming /srv/hidden/kind/<code>;",
    "an environment of PATH and A=1, a host corpus-host, a lease of a minute, an exec output bound of 64 bytes and a session bound of two processes.",
    "Tokens: all (every scope), read, servers. A reply is JSON as it is, NDJSON as the array of its lines, raw bytes as a string, none as absent;",
    "${root}, ${host}, ${PATH} and ${session} stand for what differs between servers, and * for what differs between runs.",
    "remote/corpus_test.go replays it against the reference server, and maps its refusals back through the reference client."
  ],
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "name": "info, to a principal holding every scope",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/info",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "connect": true,
        "env": [
          "PATH=${PATH}",
          "A=1"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "leaseMs": 60000,
          "maxDirEntries": 10000,
          "maxOutputBytes": 64,
          "maxProcesses": 2,
          "maxWriteBytes": 33554432
        },
        "links": true,
        "reach": "*",
        "root": "${root}",
        "scopes": [
          "read",
          "write",
          "exec",
          "servers"
        ],
        "served": {
          "host": "${host}",
          "kind": "local",
          "root": "${root}"
        },
        "start": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "info, to a principal holding servers alone: the root withheld, no host, no environment",
      "token": "servers",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/info",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "limits": {
          "leaseMs": 60000,
          "maxDirEntries": 10000,
          "maxOutputBytes": 64,
          "maxProcesses": 2,
          "maxWriteBytes": 33554432
        },
        "links": true,
        "reach": "*",
        "root": "work",
        "scopes": [
          "servers"
        ],
        "served": {
          "kind": "local",
          "root": "work"
        },
        "start": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no credentials: unauthenticated",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/info",
      "status": 401,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "unauthenticated",
          "message": "remote: unauthenticated"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "stat a file",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=inside.txt",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "modTime": "*",
        "mode": 420,
        "name": "inside.txt",
        "size": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "lstat a link",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/lstat?path=alias.txt",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "modTime": "*",
        "mode": 134218239,
        "name": "alias.txt",
        "size": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "readlink",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/readlink?path=alias.txt",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "target": "inside.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "readdir",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/readdir?path=sub",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "entries": [
          {
            "modTime": "*",
            "mode": 420,
            "name": "a.txt",
            "size": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "read a file",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/file?path=inside.txt",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "raw",
      "reply": "ok"
    },
    {
      "name": "a name that leaves: outside",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=../x",
      "status": 403,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "outside",
          "message": "path is outside the workspace"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a link that leads out: outside",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=linkout",
      "status": 403,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "outside",
          "message": "path is outside the workspace"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing by that name: not_exist",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=missing",
      "status": 404,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "not_exist",
          "message": "no such file or directory"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a name that is not valid: invalid",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=a/../b",
      "status": 400,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "invalid",
          "message": "invalid argument"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind exist, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/exist",
      "status": 409,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "exist",
          "message": "file already exists"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind permission, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/permission",
      "status": 403,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "permission",
          "message": "permission denied"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind unsupported, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/unsupported",
      "status": 501,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "unsupported",
          "message": "unsupported operation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind process_done, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/process_done",
      "status": 409,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "process_done",
          "message": "os: process already finished"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind closed, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/closed",
      "status": 410,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "closed",
          "message": "file already closed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a refusal of kind no_server, its served text naming /srv/hidden: the kind's words alone",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/stat?path=kind/no_server",
      "status": 404,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "no_server",
          "message": "no such server in this workspace"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "write a file",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "PUT",
      "path": "/v1/fs/file?path=new.txt&perm=420",
      "type": "application/octet-stream",
      "raw": "new",
      "status": 204,
      "form": "none"
    },
    {
      "name": "read it back",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/fs/file?path=new.txt",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "raw",
      "reply": "new"
    },
    {
      "name": "remove it",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/v1/fs/file?path=new.txt",
      "status": 204,
      "form": "none"
    },
    {
      "name": "write without the write scope: forbidden",
      "token": "read",
      "method": "PUT",
      "path": "/v1/fs/file?path=new.txt&perm=420",
      "type": "application/octet-stream",
      "raw": "new",
      "status": 403,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "forbidden",
          "message": "remote: the principal lacks the write scope"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a JSON route sent another type: media_type",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions",
      "type": "text/plain",
      "raw": "{}",
      "status": 415,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "media_type",
          "message": "the body must be application/json"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "list servers of a workspace that offers none: unsupported",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/servers",
      "status": 501,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "unsupported",
          "message": "unsupported operation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "exec: its status and both streams",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "sh",
          "-c",
          "echo out; echo err >&2; exit 3"
        ]
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "ndjson",
      "reply": [
        {
          "output": {
            "exitCode": 3,
            "stderr": "ZXJyCg==",
            "stdout": "b3V0Cg=="
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exec with a stream: data frames, then the output",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "sh",
          "-c",
          "echo a"
        ],
        "stream": true
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "ndjson",
      "reply": [
        {
          "data": "YQo="
        },
        {
          "output": {
            "exitCode": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exec in a dir below the root",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "ls"
        ],
        "dir": "sub"
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "ndjson",
      "reply": [
        {
          "output": {
            "exitCode": 0,
            "stdout": "YS50eHQK"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exec in a dir that leaves: an error frame",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "pwd"
        ],
        "dir": ".."
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "ndjson",
      "reply": [
        {
          "error": {
            "code": "outside",
            "message": "path is outside the workspace"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exec whose output is over the bound: limit",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "sh",
          "-c",
          "printf '%0100d' 0"
        ]
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "ndjson",
      "reply": [
        {
          "error": {
            "code": "limit",
            "message": "the command exited with status 0, but its output is 100 bytes, over the 64 an Exec without a Stream gives back; give it a Stream"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exec with a negative timeout: invalid",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "true"
        ],
        "timeoutMs": -1
      },
      "status": 400,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "invalid",
          "message": "a timeout below zero or past what a duration holds"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cancel an exec no one runs: no_process",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/exec/corpusnoexecaaaa1/cancel",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {},
      "status": 404,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "no_process",
          "message": "no exec of this principal runs under that key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "open a session",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {},
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "id": "${session}",
        "leaseMs": 60000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "start cat",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
          "cat"
        ],
        "key": "corpuscatkeyaaaa1"
      },
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "id": "corpuscatkeyaaaa1"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "its input, to its end",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/stdin",
      "type": "application/octet-stream",
      "raw": "abc",
      "status": 204,
      "form": "none"
    },
    {
      "name": "its output, to its end",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/stdout",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "raw",
      "reply": "abc"
    },
    {
      "name": "its wait",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/wait",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "status": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a signal after its exit: process_done",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/signal",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "signal": "TERM"
      },
      "status": 409,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "process_done",
          "message": "os: process already finished"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a resize of a process with no terminal: unsupported",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/resize",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "rows": 24,
        "cols": 80
      },
      "status": 501,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "unsupported",
          "message": "unsupported operation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "its close",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1",
      "status": 200,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "status": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a closed process: no_process",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes/corpuscatkeyaaaa1/wait",
      "status": 404,
      "form": "json",
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": "no_process",
          "message": "remote: no such process in this session"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "start a sleeper",
      "token": "all",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/sessions/${session}/processes",
      "type": "application/json",
      "body": {
        "args": [
